# Text files are LF in the repository and in every checkout (4.1.8): a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf would
# otherwise read CRLF where tests, hashes and the formatter expect LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.bin binary
